# Public marketing site (www.copantry.com) build-time env vars.
# Copy to `.env` (or set in your host's build config) and fill in.

# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID (e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX).
# Leave unset to disable analytics entirely — the site sends nothing without it.
# When set, Google Analytics loads ONLY after the visitor accepts the cookie
# notice (GDPR consent-gated), with IP anonymisation and ad signals disabled.
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
